# Running Commands

## Frontend (Next.js)
- Navigate to frontend: `cd frontend`
- Install dependencies: `pnpm install`
- Development server: `pnpm dev`
- Build: `pnpm build`
- Lint: `pnpm lint`

## Backend (Supabase Edge Functions)
- Start Supabase: `npx supabase start` (from project root)
- Serve edge functions: `npx supabase functions serve --no-verify-jwt`
- Test apple endpoint: `curl http://127.0.0.1:54321/functions/v1/get-incoming-apple -H "Content-Type: application/json" -d '{}'`
- Test orange endpoint: `curl http://127.0.0.1:54321/functions/v1/get-incoming-orange -H "Content-Type: application/json" -d '{}'`

## Deno Tests
- Run tests: `deno test` (from the function directory)
